      "statement": "docsweep treats OKF's type field as an open, non-enumerable vocabulary: okf-check does not reject unrecognized type values, and only plan/bugfix/pending are interpreted by docsweep's own archive/due/triage automation, while manual/reference/setup and other types pass OKF conformance checks untouched and are excluded from docsweep's automated work-state and due-date handling.",
