      "statement": "load_okf_profile() is offline by default (no source, or source='bundled', reads only the packaged JSON with no network access); a remote http:// profile fetch prints a plain-text tamper warning to stderr, a fetch without a sha256 warns that a URL redefinition would go undetected, and a supplied sha256 is verified against the fetched bytes before the profile is accepted or cached, with OkfProfileError raised rather than silently falling back to a different profile on fetch failure or hash mismatch.",
